Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:03.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.97,0:00:06.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:07.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:13.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的因缘都开始于五十年前的这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:21.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐跟犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:24.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一曲悲惨的命运悲歌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.65,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:48.83,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.31,0:00:55.08,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:01:01.32,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:06.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.43,0:01:14.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:18.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:23.27,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:27.72,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:32.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:35.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:39.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:46.59,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.27,0:02:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫做枫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个生存在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:11.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个战争不断的乱世之中的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:12.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:16.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那个时候的我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:19.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是一个完全不懂得战争
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及人们之间争夺的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要过来 小枫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人好像是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.22,0:02:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个叫作椿姑娘的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小女孩是你的妹妹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.97,0:03:06.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听着 桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.93,0:03:08.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有我一个人在就足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点带着你的妹妹退下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:14.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用你担心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:20.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼看着亲人已经身陷险境却还能如此镇定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:24.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.27,0:03:39.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:43.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是一个冷漠无情的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:45.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你不能算是一个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是一个天赋异禀的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我是巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.91,0:03:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我这辈子的宿命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:03:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚强 高雅圣洁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美丽的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:04.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于幼小的我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.19,0:04:06.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐就是我的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:08.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:11.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等待着桔梗姐姐的竟然是那样悲惨的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:14.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我作梦也没想到的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:18.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:20.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会就这样善罢甘休的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:22.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:26.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相逢之前的命运恋歌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.19,0:04:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:37.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:38.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.33,0:04:41.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个大傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对没有任何人叫了我半妖之后还能活下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:04:58.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:00.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:05.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.49,0:05:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:15.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么大声干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是钟乳洞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:19.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请过来看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钟乳洞的情形有点不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:29.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道是怎么回事吗 首领
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:36.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有这种事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领 这到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:40.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定是翠子造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翠子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个诞生出四魂之玉的传说中的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个巫女翠子已经死了好几百年了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:54.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这具尸体是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是前天消灭的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是叫作…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:06:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫什么百足妖的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来还很难缠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易把它的头打碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.41,0:06:04.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:18.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:22.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想翠子的灵魂对它有所感应
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.83,0:06:25.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领 那个难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:28.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是第一次看到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:30.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:37.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快散开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.29,0:06:46.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:48.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把四魂之玉还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:51.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:06:59.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:07.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:10.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要紧啊 首领
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:15.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是四魂之玉的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:18.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有四魂之玉在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:19.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.49,0:07:22.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能一次又一次的复活
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:28.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让她逃了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快追
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.00,0:07:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个被污染了的玉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.57,0:07:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠我们是没有办法净化的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:39.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能找巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:41.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.01,0:07:44.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找个能够净化这个玉的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.81,0:07:49.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由于游历是巫女修行之中的一个很重要的环节
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟桔梗姐姐周游列国 继续消灭妖怪的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:56.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不想要任何的报酬吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 椿姑娘你拿着就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 那就不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘 同样身为一个游历巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:07.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我送你一句忠言
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:12.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女只有抛弃人类之心才能真正的发挥她的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过既然是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.61,0:08:16.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还是有可能会坠入情网
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:17.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坠入情网
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在说我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.55,0:08:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万不要坠入情网
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要觉得男人值得你去爱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:30.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有这样的一个男人出现
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就很可能会死于非命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫做椿的女人 真是令人不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她竟然对我下了诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:54.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么 也不是什么大不了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我桔梗怎么可能爱上什么人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃不了了 半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大哥的仇我们一定要报
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:08.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然还有两个兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来躲在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接我这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血刃飞爪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:26.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:28.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你区区的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:34.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.49,0:09:41.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:43.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭这种货色我竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:46.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要变得更强才可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要更有力量才行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:09:59.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘 欢迎你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.01,0:10:01.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:04.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天早上有几个驱魔师来到我们这个地方拜访
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说桔梗姑娘您不在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.65,0:10:09.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说是晚上才要再过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:11.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是为了什么事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:18.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 快进屋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:39.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫做四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:45.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些驱魔师希望我能够除去上面的污秽将其净化
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候是我第一次看到四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:54.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来 自从收下了四魂之玉之后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐的命运就发生了巨大的变化
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:11:00.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在其他同年龄的女孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:04.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忙着为自己焚香 涂脂抹粉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,享受与恋人见面的快乐的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:13.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不快点的话今晚就…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好重的血腥味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:38.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类的女子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.81,0:11:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她真的是女人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:45.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始变化了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:52.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要躲到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:08.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是冲着四魂之玉来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:13.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个四魂之玉是什么玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:19.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过要是你不想死在我手里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:24.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不要再靠近我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:49.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么有这样的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:56.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:13:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:05.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐… 桔梗姑娘…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:08.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘… 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:11.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是小枫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:21.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然放过了我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:23.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是太没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接近了 总算接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:32.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不快点增强妖力的话 身体快吃不消了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:38.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 是这么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:40.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:42.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好像满有意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:46.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个家伙好像是叫桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:57.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个能够增强妖力 很特异的玉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:04.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音我好像在哪里听过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个时候躲着不敢出来的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.15,0:14:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把四魂之玉给我交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.82,0:14:14.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得我觉得你的妖气不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:23.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个半妖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:27.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就能变成真正的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.27,0:14:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就那么想要一个容身之地吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:34.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那是真正强大的力量吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.05,0:14:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少说废话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:41.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要成为最强大的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:43.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就这么决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我成功的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先就要把你撕成碎片进行血祭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.19,0:14:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有我净化四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:53.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且守护着四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:54.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不看看你自己的身上满是妖怪之血的腥味
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:02.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到你的痛处了 是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:03.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你不想死在我的手里的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:07.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不要再靠近我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有第三次的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:12.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会放弃的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:15.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你逃到哪里我一定能够找到你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:18.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你身上这股刺鼻的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:19.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就能找到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:23.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气味…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:42.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:43.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧 小枫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.91,0:15:44.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:47.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.49,0:15:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 把四魂之玉交出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:52.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又出现啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会放弃的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:15:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就让我们做个了断
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:01.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点叫这个小不点滚远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:04.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小枫 你先到一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.47,0:16:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:14.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沿着血腥之路不断往前走的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能算人类 又不是真正的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断寻找自己的位置 可怜的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个问题想先问你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.43,0:16:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天晚上 你为什么没有把我给杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候的我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:35.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要杀我的话应该不费吹灰之力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:39.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本大爷怎么可能做出那种趁人之危的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.07,0:16:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有最后一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:48.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖 你叫做什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:50.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总还是有个名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:53.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖 半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说那么多遍干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.65,0:16:57.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就报上名来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:59.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样以后我就不会再叫你半妖了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:05.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉悟吧 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:21.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么老是不给我最后一击啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.41,0:17:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要在我身边晃来晃去的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:28.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再浪费我的箭来射你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那时候也觉得不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:36.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么桔梗姐姐下不了手杀犬夜叉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.23,0:17:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么她只有不对犬夜叉射出破魔之箭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那个时候开始
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:46.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐每天都会去水边沐浴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:48.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在回想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:50.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打从与犬夜叉相遇的那天开始
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:53.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就一直持续那样的习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笊法草
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得姐姐好像说能用来消肿的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:03.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:10.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你当成人质
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:10.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.39,0:18:13.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从桔梗那把四魂之玉抢过来...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趴下 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.51,0:18:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能让四魂之玉\N落到你这种小妖怪的手上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你救了我的命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.55,0:18:34.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想让四魂之玉落到别人的手上而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.55,0:18:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时觉得很不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么犬夜叉不像百足妖怪那样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:46.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我抓起来当成人质呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐知道百足妖的尸骨之中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还存在着妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.07,0:19:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里面的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:04.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就感应不到四魂之玉的力量了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你在那里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:11.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你下来好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.85,0:19:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你近距离的说话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:17.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这好像是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:21.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你救了我妹妹小枫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.89,0:19:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就为了那个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也该当面跟你说声谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做不像你做的事行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 我看起来是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.97,0:19:38.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是人类吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:45.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来不向任何人示弱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:47.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不能有丝毫犹豫彷徨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则就会被妖怪有机可乘
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.19,0:19:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然身为人类 却不能当普通的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你跟我很相似
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:20:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟身为半妖的你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我无法狠心把你给杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.27,0:20:05.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 原来是发牢骚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:07.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不像你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:12.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不像我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.15,0:20:20.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:25.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:31.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:33.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:36.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明天再到这里来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候我有东西要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:44.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有东西要给我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:45.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那正好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:48.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有东西想要当面交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是四魂之玉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.55,0:20:51.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:54.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个好像叫做言灵的念珠
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要把它送给犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:12.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有点像是暗算
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:16.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是要为了不让他继续做坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.17,0:21:19.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:22.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇魂的咒语  我应该说些什么才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.95,0:21:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:27.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得她看起来好像很高兴的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫做椿的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我身上下了怪异的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经走在修罗之路上的我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:44.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事到如今还会在乎什么死于非命的下场吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:46.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇魂的咒语 也许可以用心爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我拿着这个东西也没什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送给你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我娘临终之前留给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也只有这个东西和火鼠袍子了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈她是个人类吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:18.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么珍贵的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.07,0:22:19.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用那么在意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:22.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正火鼠袍子对我已经够管用了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很对不起 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.31,0:22:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好几次把它给射破了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.75,0:22:34.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个你就不用在意了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:36.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒是你之前说过要送给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.05,0:22:37.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.60,0:22:47.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.33,0:22:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 让人家空欢喜一场
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:52.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个真的可以送给我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.50,0:22:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:07.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉和桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.13,0:23:28.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个夜晚 桔梗姐姐涂上了口红
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.71,0:23:32.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来真的好美
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.71,0:23:36.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是即使是年少不懂事的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也看出了她眼中有着不知名的悲哀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 接下来我们要玩什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.53,0:23:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.67,0:23:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要待在那里嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来跟我们一起玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.51,0:24:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丢沙包好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.64,0:24:04.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去采野花
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.55,0:24:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.69,0:24:19.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么练都练不到姐姐的程度
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.76,0:24:25.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真努力 小枫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.36,0:24:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.37,0:24:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.34,0:24:36.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.21,0:24:37.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.24,0:24:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.58,0:24:42.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.65,0:24:50.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想再看一看美丽的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.49,0:24:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想尽自己一份心力帮助姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.59,0:24:57.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来还以为只有我一个人是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.04,0:25:11.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点{\fad(0,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.15,0:25:18.92,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.02,0:25:27.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.33,0:25:33.50,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.91,0:25:42.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伸手触摸 那微尘般的希望之星{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.64,0:25:51.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使勉强握住 横冲直撞的我们想往何处?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.49,0:25:57.48,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保有自我 Let's go and Try 前进吧 使命只有One way{\fad(0,25)}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.43,0:26:04.52,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺其自然 Do it! Ready? 最后愿望将达成{\fad(50,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.70,0:26:11.50,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.61,0:26:18.51,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.68,0:26:26.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.89,0:26:33.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧{\fad(0,300)}
